Kausalya hears Bharata come and seeks him trembling --- Bharata and Shatrughna embrace fallen senseless Kausalya --- Kausalya charges Bharata won thornless kingdom cruelly --- Kausalya begs to be sent to Rama forest --- Bharata folds hands denies knowledge of exile --- Bharata swears sin if he approved noble exile --- Kausalya halts oaths affirming Bharata holds dharma --- Night passes as senseless Bharata breathes and laments
